 {:db/id "q-3946" :question/id #uuid "494506ed-3be9-5fa5-a304-e992bf8e5303" :question/math-academy-id "q-3946" :question/problem "Calculate ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }(4{x}^{2}-5x+16).$" :question/worked-solution "We identify the leading term and compute its limit:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }(4{x}^{2}-5x+16) & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }(4{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =4\\cdot {lim}_{x\\to \\infty }({x}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\infty \\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-3946/ma-source-field/8d4225ae78a6ee3d97ac230be9e8b7bf60e34d175dbcab2dbaa4eba1d9d16a82"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
